#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Starlight`_ is a documentation framework built on top of the `Astro`_ web "
"framework."
msgstr "`Starlight`_ 是一个构建在 `Astro`_ Web 框架之上的文档框架。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:14
msgid ""
"Minimal configuration is required to build an existing Starlight project on "
"Read the Docs."
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上构建现有 Starlight 项目所需的配置极少。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:16
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:42
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:44
msgid ""
"If you have an existing Starlight project you want to host on Read the Docs,"
" check out our :doc:`/intro/add-project` guide."
msgstr "如果你已有想在 Read the Docs 上托管的 Starlight 项目，请参阅 :doc:`/intro/add-project` 指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:45
msgid ""
"If you're new to Starlight, check out the official `Getting started with "
"Starlight`_ guide."
msgstr "如果你还不熟悉 Starlight，请参阅官方的 `Getting started with Starlight`_ 指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:50
msgid "Using the proper base path"
msgstr "使用正确的基础路径"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:52
msgid ""
"To ensure that your Starlight site works correctly on Read the Docs, you "
"need to set the ``site`` and ``base`` options in your Astro configuration:"
msgstr ""
"为确保你的 Starlight 站点在 Read the Docs 上正常运行，你需要在 Astro 配置中设置 ``site`` 和 ``base``"
" 选项："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:55
msgid "astro.config.mjs"
msgstr "astro.config.mjs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/starlight.rst:78
msgid ""
"Links starting with ``/`` in your content are not prefixed with the base "
"path. Use relative links (e.g. ``./guides/example/``) so they work under the"
" version path."
msgstr "内容中以 ``/`` 开头的链接不会添加基础路径前缀。请使用相对链接（例如 ``./guides/example/`` ），以便它们在版本路径下正常工作。"

